1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Open the Portal at cleanroom.knowledgeondemand.net

2
00:00:03,354 --> 00:00:06,354
Enter username 'admin' and password, then click Sign In

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:10,380
The Portal shows two cards: Deployment Console and Scanning Console

4
00:00:10,882 --> 00:00:13,882
Click 'Credentials' to view service passwords

5
00:00:15,497 --> 00:00:18,497
Each service shows its URL, username, and password

6
00:00:18,502 --> 00:00:21,502
Click the eye icon to reveal a password

7
00:00:21,069 --> 00:00:24,069
Navigate back to the Portal landing page

8
00:00:24,245 --> 00:00:27,245
Click a card to navigate with automatic single sign-on

9
00:00:29,336 --> 00:00:32,336
You are automatically logged in to the Deployment Console

10
00:00:32,339 --> 00:00:35,339
The Dashboard shows deployment status and service credentials

11
00:00:35,343 --> 00:00:38,343
That's the basics — you're ready to use Talos CleanRoom!
